  "guide": "Here `rootProjection n` is $E_{00}\\in A_n$, `ofStage n` is $\\iota_n$, and `rootFlag n` is $f_n\\in A$. The exact right-hand side uses these two operations only. The state $\\omega$ in the prose is `rootState`; the projection, order, and compression facts have their own exact declarations.",
